{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/reconcile(with:deleting:preserving:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"mutating","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"reconcile","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"with","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"remote","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV","text":"EntityStore","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deleting","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deletedIDs","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV","text":"UUID","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"preserving","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV","text":"UUID","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">)","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"remote","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The rows read from storage for the IDs in question. Rows for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"IDs the caller didn’t ask about are simply not here, and their"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"absence means nothing."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"deletedIDs","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"IDs storage reports as deleted elsewhere. Removed with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same origin a full reconcile uses, so no deletion is recorded and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"none is echoed back to the store it came from. An ID that "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"remote"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"still holds is "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" removed however it is named here: a live row"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is positive evidence, and a tombstone can be stale."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"preserving","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"IDs the caller knows carry unflushed local intent, exactly"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as in the full reconcile. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"remote"},{"type":"text","text":" has no authority over them, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"neither does "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deletedIDs"},{"type":"text","text":". This store’s own un-drained "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/changes","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"folded in automatically."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The counterpart to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/reconcile(with:preserving:removingMissing:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" for a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"partial read — a refresh of the rows a sync tick reported as changed,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rather than of the whole table. Absorbing rows works identically; what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"changes is where deletions come from.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A partial snapshot ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"cannot"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" infer deletion from absence. An ID missing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from it was not deleted, it was not asked for, and treating the two alike","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"would empty the store on the first partial merge. So removal is driven","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entirely by ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deletedIDs"},{"text":", which the caller must have positive evidence","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for — a history tombstone, not an empty result.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Does ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" record changes — this is a hydration operation, for the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reason the full reconcile isn’t one.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"metadata":{"title":"reconcile(with:deleting:preserving:)","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Swidux"}],"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV9reconcile4with8deleting10preservingyACyxG_Shy10Foundation4UUIDVGALtF","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"reconcile","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"with","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV","text":"EntityStore","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deleting","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV","text":"UUID","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"preserving","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV","text":"UUID","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">)","kind":"text"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Reconciles this store against a snapshot covering only "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"some","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" of its IDs."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/reconcile(with:deleting:preserving:)"]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore"]]},"references":{"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux":{"url":"\/documentation\/swidux","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Redux-style state management for SwiftUI, with macros for observability and ready-made plugins for persistence, undo, paywalls, version killswitches, and parental gates."}],"title":"Swidux","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux","type":"topic"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore/changes":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/changes","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"changes"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ChangeSet","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux9ChangeSetV"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/changes","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Accumulated changes since the last "},{"code":"resetChanges()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" call."}],"title":"changes","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore","abstract":[{"type":"tex